{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEP","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"西番雅書","commonName":"西番雅書","title":"西番雅書","order":36,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"831988651ecf9325c83dd1e77b70d29c47c26109148cecfe009029ff5637d6c2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":51},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["呼籲百姓悔改"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["不知羞恥的國民啊，",{"text":"趁命令尚未發出、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"日子尚未消逝如風中的糠秕、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的烈怒尚未臨到你們、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂向你們發怒的日子尚未來臨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聚集，聚集起來！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世上所有遵守耶和華典章的謙卑人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要尋求耶和華，追求公義，追求謙卑。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也許在耶和華發怒的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們可以得到庇護。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["審判以色列的鄰國"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"迦薩必被拋棄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞實基倫必淪為廢墟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞實突的居民必在中午被趕走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以革倫必被連根拔除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住在海邊的基利提人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"非利士人的迦南啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華宣告要毀滅你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你杳無人煙。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沿海地區必成為草場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有牧人的居所和羊圈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那裡必歸給猶大家的餘民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必在那裡放牧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"晚上睡在亞實基倫的房屋裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們的上帝耶和華必眷顧他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們回歸故土。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"以色列的上帝——萬軍之耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我聽見了摩押人的譭謗和亞捫人的辱罵。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們譭謗我的子民，揚言侵佔他們的土地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我憑自己的永恆起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押和亞捫必刺草叢生、鹽坑遍地、永遠荒廢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如所多瑪和蛾摩拉一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我餘下的子民必擄掠他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我倖存的百姓必承受他們的土地。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是他們的報應，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們狂妄自大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羞辱萬軍之耶和華的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必令他們恐懼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂要削弱世上的神明。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天下萬民必在本地敬拜祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古實人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們也必死在耶和華的刀下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必伸手攻擊北方，毀滅亞述，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使尼尼微一片荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如乾旱的曠野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牲畜和野獸必躺臥在那裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"貓頭鷹和刺蝟棲身在房柱上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"窗口傳出鳥鳴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"門庭都必破敗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"露出香柏木梁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這就是那歡樂安逸、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自以為天下無雙的城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在竟然如此荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成為野獸棲息之地！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"路過的人都搖手嘲笑它。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}